    {
      "id": "jiangnan-shu-roads",
      "title": "Jiangnan & the Shu Roads",
      "titleZh": "江南与蜀道",
      "subtitle": "Canals, yellow mountains, river cities and the old road into Sichuan.",
      "subtitleZh": "水巷、黄山、江城的雾，与通往四川的旧路。",
      "note": "A slow month of water towns, cloud seas, teahouses and night trains. Fast rail where it helps; long afternoons where it does not.",
      "noteZh": "用一个慢月，走水乡、云海、茶馆与夜车。能坐高铁的地方坐高铁，该慢下来的地方就慢下来。",
      "color": "terracotta",
